    /// Reads the surface's frame counters. `dropped` and `failed` are the two
    /// numbers a producer needs to see: the first says the producer is faster
    /// than the decoder, the second says frames are arriving broken.
    def stats() -> ScreencastStats: return ScreencastStats.parse(self.native.stats())

    /// Reads the surface's error stream. Every call returns a view of the same
    /// bounded queue.
